# GRUB SHIFT: how grubs grow, as the wiki puts it. Each night one type of
# grub that still has grubs alive evolves: every grub of that colour goes up
# a level (larva, adult, queen) and its new grubs hatch at that level from
# then on. Only two types evolve in a contract. A queen left alive becomes an
# egg overnight. A field cleared by nightfall evolves nothing.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat rest
wait 120
expect grown_types == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat bug 5 4 1 0
cheat rest
wait 120
expect stage0 == 1
expect lv_at54 == 1
expect grown_larvae == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat bug 5 4 1 1
cheat rest
wait 120
expect stage0 == 2
expect lv_at54 == 2
expect grown_types == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat bug 5 4 1 2
cheat bug 0 4 5 0
cheat rest
wait 120
expect lv_at54 == 3
expect lv_at04 == 1
expect stage2 == 1
expect grown_types == 2
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat bug 0 4 3 0
cheat rest
wait 120
expect lv_at04 == 0
expect stage1 == 0
